# Optional local Worker secrets for website lead email.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) when using `wrangler` / Cloudflare Vite.
#
# Preferred (Resend — verified sender domain):
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxx
# LEAD_EMAIL_FROM=LumenX Leads <leads@yourdomain.com>
#
# Or Web3Forms (free key emailed to you from https://web3forms.com — enter lumenxtech.official@gmail.com):
# WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key
#
# Inbox (also set in wrangler.jsonc vars):
# LEAD_EMAIL_TO=lumenxtech.official@gmail.com
#
# Without Resend/Web3Forms, /api/leads uses FormSubmit.
# First FormSubmit delivery sends an “Activate Form” email — check Spam, click once, resubmit.
